@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Lockdown enforcement (Module 4): Views/ExamWindow (Window_Loaded -> LockdownCoordinator.Start(this), Window_Closing -> Dispose).
' Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator: Start returns at once when the mode is Off; TaskManagerRegistryGuard.Apply (only when the
' Task Manager policy is on), KeyboardHookService.Install, ClipboardGuardService.Start(window), ProcessGuardService.Start (2 s scan),
' DeviceGuardService.Start (WMI: VirtualMachine, UsbInserted, MultiMonitor, RemoteSession). A failed Apply / Install is
' Report("LockdownDegraded", ...), i.e. the same path as any violation. Report: 15 s cooldown keyed on reason|detail, then the
' violation sink LiveMonitoringService.ReportViolation (encrypted MonitoringSpool + CaptureForViolation + fire-and-forget
' FlushEventsAsync -> ApiClient.SendEventBatchAsync, POST /api/monitoring/events/batch; the server side is in seq_telemetry).
' With no sink, LockdownCoordinator calls ApiClient.SendMonitoringEventAsync (POST /api/monitoring/event); with a sink but no
' spool, LiveMonitoringService.ReportViolation makes that call itself (no screenshot). Both fire-and-forget.
' Stop (from Dispose, OnCrash, OnProcessExit, OnDispatcherCrash): Restore, Uninstall, then Stop on the other three guards.
' Open arrowhead (->>) = asynchronous message (C# event raised by a guard, fire-and-forget call).
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 2
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

participant "Lockdown\nCoordinator" as LC
participant "Live\nMonitoring\nService" as LMS
participant "ApiClient" as API
LC -> LC ++ : report: once per\nviolation per 15 s
alt monitoring service set
  LC -> LMS : report violation
  activate LMS
  alt encrypted outbox present
    LMS -> LMS : store in outbox;\ntake screenshot
    LMS ->> API : send event batch\n(kept until sent)
  else no outbox
    LMS ->> API : send one event
  end
  LMS --> LC
  deactivate LMS
else no monitoring service
  LC ->> API : send one event
end
deactivate LC
@enduml
